{"id":"658033","name":"紫菜鱿鱼饼","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658033/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鱿鱼","amount":"1个"},{"name":"紫菜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"番薯粉","amount":"2勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"锅加热放入紫菜将两面煎至绿色，煎好后放保鲜袋捏碎。","img":"images/658033/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鱿鱼洗净撕去膜。","img":"images/658033/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"改刀切小丁。","img":"images/658033/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入捏碎的紫菜。","img":"images/658033/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"打入鸡蛋。","img":"images/658033/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入番薯粉，少许盐和胡椒粉调味。","img":"images/658033/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"抓拌均匀。","img":"images/658033/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"至无干粉状态。","img":"images/658033/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中少许底油，舀入面糊。","img":"images/658033/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"小火慢煎至定型。","img":"images/658033/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煎至两面金黄即可。","img":"images/658033/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658033/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658033/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658033/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}